/// Edit-strategy-name operation variant. `Edit` overwrites with the user-
/// supplied name; `Restore` resets the bot's name back to the platform
/// default. Serializes on the wire as the lower-case variant.
/// 
/// `#[derive(uniffi::Enum)]` so native callers (the iOS rename provider)
/// can pass the action variant straight through to
/// [`crate::public::interactors::common::rename_bot::RenameBotInteractor`]
/// via its `set_submit_options` action.
/// 
/// `Default` is `Edit` so the `RenameBotState`'s `#[derive(Default)]`
/// expansion compiles without the field having to be hand-initialised
/// at every state-construction site. `Edit` is the historical (pre-
/// backtest, pre-restore) behaviour, so defaulting to it preserves
/// existing semantics for any caller that forgets to call
/// `set_submit_options`.
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]
pub enum EditStrategyNameAction {
    Edit,
    Restore,
}

