/// `!isDetailPage`), and Event History / Share have no wired Rust journey yet. They exist
/// up front so a variant can be added to the *derivation* later without breaking every
/// exhaustive Kotlin `when` block already written against this enum — the same reasoning
/// Spot Grid's action enums were fully populated at inception.
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]
