/// Stable, locale-independent identity of a row on the Spot Grid Smart-strategy
/// (AI) order-confirmation sheet. Lets native clients apply compliance rules
/// (e.g. hide the 180-day backtested APR) WITHOUT matching localized label text,
/// the localization key, the row index, or the displayed value.
/// 
/// Invariant: at most ONE row per sheet carries `BacktestedApr`. New variants are
/// appended at the END of this declaration only (UniFFI encodes variants by their
/// declaration-order ordinal, so inserting mid-list would shift existing ordinals
/// and break the Swift/Kotlin binding ABI).
