/// This is a presentation identity, orthogonal to `SpotGridAiOrderDetailRowKind`
/// (which stays Source/Divider/Value). The core never reads region, entity, mode,
/// or restriction state for it; hiding a row stays a client decision. The default
/// is `Source`, a non-APR variant, so a row built without an explicit id can never
/// be mistaken for the backtested-APR row.
