/// One Contract DCA smart-params (AI) recommendation.
/// 
/// Mirrors the `stgyParam` object on each entry returned by the strategy
/// recommendation list endpoint. The interactor selects the entry whose
/// `direction` matches the current form direction and whose `user_risk_mode`
/// is `"moderate"` (falling back to the first entry), then applies the
/// recommended fields to its form state.
/// 
/// All percentage fields (`px_steps`, `tp_pct`, `sl_pct`) are server-side
/// decimals (e.g. `"0.005"` = 0.5%); the interactor converts them to UI %
/// via `mul_by_100` before storing, matching how config defaults are seeded.
