    /// 
    /// A gate field for the shared lead-trader profit-share card, which legacy
    /// feeds as `resp.bot?.common?.minFollowInvestAmount`
    /// (`OverviewFragment.kt:281`). Raw, not a display: `BotDetailLeadInfoFragment`
    /// formats it and re-renders the threshold row live, so a `BotDisplayText` here
    /// would be formatted twice.
