    /// the category is valid but nothing has a usable backtest result.
    /// 
    /// The server has already dropped assets with no successful backtest
    /// and those with a negative annualized rate (`0` is kept), and it
    /// preserves the upstream ordering — so this list must be rendered in
    /// the order received, never re-sorted by APY.
