/// Single shared type that flows from native → interactor → facade →
/// internal service → use case → request. Serialization derives let the
/// request layer post this type directly to the API.
/// 
/// `amount` is user-typed free text; per `observability.md` PII rules,
/// log only its length (not the raw string) in success/start logs.
#[derive(Debug, Clone, PartialEq)]
pub struct RecurringEditAmountInput {
    pub algo_id: String,
    pub amount: String,
}

