    /// `ProfitChartSectionAdapter.fromSpotDca`). This is the `>0` Up / `<0` Down /
    /// `==0` or blank Neutral SIGN decision on the RAW `pnl_ratio` =
    /// [`pnl_color_of`] — DISTINCT from `pnl_ratio_display`'s precision-only color
    /// (`getPnlColor(fmtBotDigitPnlPercent(_))`), so it cannot reuse that field's
