    /// `OKTSSpotGridService::adjust_investment_service()` — both grid
    /// facades expose the same handle shape so a screen scoped to either
    /// variant can compose the interactor uniformly. See
    /// `cross_bot_action_interactors.md` for the handle pattern.
    /// ```ignore
    /// let handle = OKTSContractGridService::new().adjust_investment_service();
    /// let interactor = AdjustInvestmentInteractor::create(algo_id, inst_id, handle);
    /// ```
