/// The body is the identity, and `ArbPriceSettingsSeed.pause_enabled` carries the same
/// fact, so this is a second FFI route to one truth. Kept anyway, for the reason the
/// rest of this module exists: the host calls it at the moment native called
/// `actionAutomatic`, so the native rule has ONE named home and changing it — if the
/// design ever gates the pause row on something else — is a one-line edit here rather
/// than a hunt through two hosts. The `Seed` field is the value at sheet-open; this is
/// the recomputation on every toggle. Same answer today, different instants.
