/// Distinct from the Info tab's two price funnels on purpose:
/// `smart_iceberg_price_display_plain` returns an UNGROUPED `Raw` (its legacy
/// leaf is `toPlainString`) and `smart_iceberg_price_display_suffixed` bakes the
/// symbol into the value. This row is the plain grouped `Number`.
